# Drive calculation

## Design parameters

- Conveyor length: 1.2 m
- Belt width: 300 mm
- Maximum load: 20 kg
- Belt speed: 0.3 m/s
- Pulley diameter: 80 mm (initial assumption)

## Pulley speed 线速度

v = pi * D * n / 60

n = 60 * 0.3 / (pi * 0.08)

n = 71.6 rpm

So the drive pulley should rotate at about 72 rpm.

## Next step

Calculate:
- resistance force 牵引力F（需要多少力，才能把输送带拉起来）
- required torque 所需扭矩 T=F*r
- motor power 电机功率P P=Fv
- gear ratio 减速比
